<title>USA: Dartmouth College taxable deal yields 7.48 pct.</title>
<headline>Dartmouth College taxable deal yields 7.48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prager McCarthy &amp; Sealy said Wednesday it priced $30 million taxable Dartmouth College, N.H., bonds at par with a 7.48 percent coupon in the sole 6/1/2026 maturity.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
